 "remarks": "Lovely Modern Farmhouse in desirable RIVERSIDE, completed in 2019. Enjoy all the conveniences this quiet location has to offer (North Mianus & Eastern Middle School, shopping, beach,train and easy access to I-95). Great attention to detail both inside and out. Board & Baton exterior with stone trim. Contemporary interior with Open Floor Plan. 4 large en-suite bedrooms w. walk-in California Closets. Mudroom/Office on main floor. additional attic space -playroom, 5th bedroom &/or 2nd home office. Gourmet chef's kitchen, double-wide fridge/freezer, large island, wine fridge and built in Miele Coffee system. Finished, walk-out lower level, large deck, and lovely mature trees. The perfect rental, in one of the most desirable neighborhoods in Greenwich.",
